	(layer "F.Cu")
	(descr "PCB coil (COIL_PEND), the footprint's own copper, a net tie between pads 1 and 2: 4 layers in series (F/In1/In2/B), 12 + 12 + 12.5 + 12.5 turns (49.0 in all), r 3.00-15.00 mm (copper edges), 0.60 mm track at 0.912-0.950 mm pitch; L 33.2 uH, R 2.29 ohm (DC, 1 oz, 20 C); 3 layer changes (pads 3-5). Pads 1, 2 at +y, 15.75 mm out; current into pad 1 turns clockwise seen from the top. Keep-out to r 15.30, courtyard r 15.25. Generated by gen/coils.py")
	(tags "PCB coil spiral inductor net tie")
